# M7 Usage: sendEmail
# 描述：通过 AI 模型撰写邮件

protocol: M7-0.1
intent: Compose a professional email based on the given details
input:
  - name: recipient
    type: string
    required: true
    description: 收件人邮箱
  - name: subject
    type: string
    required: true
    description: 邮件主题
  - name: body_points
    type: string
    required: true
    description: 邮件正文要点（逗号分隔）
output:
  format: m7-compressed
  schema: email.v1
---
Compose a professional email. Recipient: {{recipient}}. Subject: {{subject}}. Key points to cover: {{body_points}}. Output the complete email with To, Subject, and Body.
